:"The transaction is expected to generate annualized cost savings of at least $15 million through reducing public company and administrative costs, and is expected to be accretive to operating results and cash flow by 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/glaukos-gkos-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GKOS 2019 Q2","e":"gkos","d":"2019-08-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Joe Gilliam","x":"So it looks like you guys raised it a little bit, but given you already raised guidance a little bit conservatively on the first-quarter call.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/glaukos-gkos-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GKOS 2019 Q3","e":"gkos","d":"2019-11-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Chris Calcaterra","x":"But we did see an impact of the cut in the tariff in the UK.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/glaukos-gkos-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GKOS 2019 Q3","e":"gkos","d":"2019-11-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Chris Calcaterra","x":"In terms of what we're doing, we're working with the ophthalmic leaders and the societies and other organizations within the UK to try and get and secure a more appropriate tariff, and we're hopeful that that will happen, but you never know.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/glaukos-gkos-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GKOS 2019 Q4","e":"gkos","d":"2020-02-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Chris Cooley","x":"Historically, you've benefited from price increases as we started each year for the original iStent, and then obviously, with the inject.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/28/glaukos-gkos-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GKOS 2019 Q4","e":"gkos","d":"2020-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tom Burns","x":"The communication in December to Avedro employees on their specific stat